{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56302","headline":"天池寺 · 存初公","name":"天池寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉王峰上拥楼台，万绿阴中石镜开。\n明月和僧窗外立，天风吹鹤日边来。\n一匡翠岫烟霞好，九叠云屏海岳魁。\n爽气荡空尘世少，仙人爲我洗茶杯。\n（见嘉靖《九江府志》卷十五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"存初公","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}